    <text class="sm left" x="495" y="138">'Ω' (Greek) : 4 Bytes</text>
    <text class="sm left" x="495" y="161">'🔥' (Emoji) : 4 Bytes</text>
    <text class="sm" x="575" y="177" fill="#f87171" font-weight="700">Simple but memory heavy</text>`);
}

